OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F343A1786915122
OL,3,CEuropean Athletics medal ceremonies
OL,4,Cdelayed as police make arrest in
OL,5,CBirmingham
OL,7,FMedal ceremonies at the European
OL,8,FAthletics Championships in Birmingham
OL,9,Fwere postponed on Saturday and
OL,10,Ftransport was suspended after a man
OL,11,Fwas arrested on suspicion of fraud.
OL,13,FThe crowd at the Alexander Stadium
OL,14,Fappeared to be near its 23,000
OL,15,Fcapacity to watch Saturday's evening
OL,16,Fsession, which concluded with Great
OL,17,FBritain winning a pair of gold medals
OL,18,Fin the men's and women's 4x100m relays.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/6
