FL,344,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F343A1786915122
OL,3,CEuropean Athletics medal ceremonies
OL,4,Cdelayed as police make arrest in
OL,5,CBirmingham
OL,7,FAt one point during the session, there
OL,8,Fwas an announcement that six medal
OL,9,Fceremonies, scheduled to take place
OL,10,Fafter the final event between 10pm and
OL,11,F11pm, were cancelled.
OL,13,FIt's understood this decision was
OL,14,Ftaken in relation to the police
OL,15,Fincident.
OL,17,FTournament organisers said transport
OL,18,Foperations had returned to normal in
OL,19,Fthe early hours of this morning
OL,20,F(Sunday, August 17).
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
