CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F343A1786915122
OL,3,CEuropean Athletics medal ceremonies
OL,4,Cdelayed as police make arrest in
OL,5,CBirmingham
OL,7,FA statement from Birmingham 2026 said:
OL,8,F"Birmingham 2026 can confirm that
OL,9,Ftransport operations have returned to
OL,10,Fnormal following a police incident on
OL,11,FSaturday evening.
OL,13,F"Championship transport was suspended
OL,14,Funtil the necessary security measures
OL,15,Fhad been carried out whilst West
OL,16,FMidlands Police arrested a man in his
OL,17,Fthirties on suspicion of fraud.
OL,26,@pD@AOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/6
