PN,34304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F343A1786915122
OL,3,CEuropean Athletics medal ceremonies
OL,4,Cdelayed as police make arrest in
OL,5,CBirmingham
OL,7,F"The safety and wellbeing of our
OL,8,Fspectators, athletes, workforce and
OL,9,Fthe wider Championships' family will
OL,10,Falways be our first priority.
OL,12,F"We recognise that the delays
OL,13,Fpresented challenges for those
OL,14,Faffected and would like to thank
OL,15,Feveryone for their patience,
OL,16,Funderstanding and cooperation
OL,17,Fthroughout the evening."
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@AOUyD@XO]
