OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F343A1786915122
OL,3,CEuropean Athletics medal ceremonies
OL,4,Cdelayed as police make arrest in
OL,5,CBirmingham
OL,7,FA West Midlands Police spokesperson
OL,8,Fconfirmed a man in his 30s was
OL,9,Farrested on suspicion of fraud and
OL,10,Fremained in custody for questioning.
OL,12,FSeveral people on social media said
OL,13,Fthey were told there had been a
OL,14,F"security incident".
OL,16,FA statement on the event's official
OL,17,Faccount, posted on X at 11:03pm, read:
OL,18,F"We apologise for the significant
OL,19,Fdelays in leaving the Alexander
OL,20,FStadium venue this evening.
OL,26,@vD@AOUvD@SO]zD@AOU
