OL,3,CEuropean Athletics medal ceremonies
OL,4,Cdelayed as police make arrest in
OL,5,CBirmingham
OL,7,F"Buses and coaches will start to
OL,8,Farrive and departures will begin to
OL,9,Fgradually take place.
OL,11,F"We thank you for your patience with
OL,12,Fthis matter. Please listen to the
OL,13,Finstructions from the safety personnel
OL,14,Fand marshals who are there to support
OL,15,Fyou."
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@AOUwD@EO]
